{"date": "2026-11-07", "cat": "전시·행사", "title": "중국 문화유산 및 예술품 특별 감정·선발회 개최 (2026. 11. 27.)", "body": "2026년 11월 27일(금) 오전 9시부터 서울 서대문구 남가좌동 DMC빌딩 1~2층에서 중국 문화유산 및 고미술·예술품 특별 감정·선발회를 엽니다. 중국 박물관 해외회류 프로젝트와 RWA 상장을 위한 감정·선발 작업이며, 접수·문의는 010-8606-1141입니다.", "html": "<div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;font-family:'Pretendard','Noto Sans KR',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;color:#222;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-align:left\">\n\n  <!-- [1] 표지 -->\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16213e 0%,#1f2c4a 55%,#0f3460 100%);color:#fff;padding:50px 28px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.12);border:1px solid #d4af37\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;background:rgba(212,175,55,.2);color:#f3d06b;border:1px solid #d4af37;padding:6px 16px;border-radius:50px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:20px\">[초청] 글로벌 예술품 거래의 새로운 패러다임</span>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff\">중국 문화유산 및 예술품<br><span style=\"color:#f3d06b\">특별 감정·선발회</span> 개최</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#e0e6ed;margin:0 0 32px\">귀하가 소장하신 귀중한 예술품이<br>세계 시장과 박물관으로 나아갈 뜻깊은 기회</p>\n    <div style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding-top:20px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#d4af37\">주최 : 천도예술품국제교류센터 (회장 장유성)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [2] 비전 -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">01. 설립 비전</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 16px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">왜 지금, <span style=\"color:#b8860b\">천도예술품국제교류센터</span>인가요?</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:15px;color:#4a5568;margin:0 0 20px\">천도예술품국제교류센터는 혁신적인 <strong>RWA(실물연계자산)</strong> 시스템과 오는 <strong>2027년 2월 시행되는 STO(토큰증권)</strong> 제도를 기반으로, 전 세계 예술품의 투명한 교류와 거래 활성화를 선도하기 위해 설립되었습니다.</p>\n    <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border-left:4px solid #d4af37;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b\">\"폐쇄적인 고미술 시장을 넘어, 누구나 신뢰하고 거래할 수 있는 글로벌 디지털 거래 표준을 만듭니다.\"</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [3] RWA & STO -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">02. 핵심 인프라</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 24px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">예술품 가치를 극대화하는 <span style=\"color:#0f3460\">2대 금융·기술 시스템</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"background:#f1f5f9;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0f3460;margin-bottom:8px\">① RWA (Real World Asset · 실물연계자산)</div>\n      <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155\">\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><strong>개념:</strong> 예술품 등 현실 세계의 유·무형 자산을 블록체인 기반 디지털 토큰으로 변환하는 기술</li>\n        <li><strong>기대 효과:</strong> 감정 이력 및 소유권 내역이 영구 기록되어 위·변조 원천 차단, 24시간 글로벌 유동성 확보</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background:#fdfbf7;border:1px solid #ebd9a6;padding:22px;border-radius:12px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#9a6b00;margin-bottom:8px\">② STO (Security Token Offering · 토큰증권 발행)</div>\n      <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155\">\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><strong>개념:</strong> 실물 자산 기반 토큰에 자본시장법상 '증권성'을 부여하여 제도권 내에서 합법적으로 발행·유통하는 방식</li>\n        <li><strong>기대 효과:</strong> <strong>2027년 2월 제도 시행</strong>에 맞춰 고가 예술품의 분할 유동화 및 소장가의 원활한 자금 조달 실현</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [4] 공신력·판로 -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">03. 글로벌 네트워크</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 24px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">완벽한 공신력과 검증된 <span style=\"color:#b8860b\">글로벌 판매 판로</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7;padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🏛️ 탄탄한 글로벌 구매·판매망 확보</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">중국의 주요 국·공립 및 민영 박물관, 전 세계 유력 수장가들과 구매대행 계약을 체결하여 실질적인 매각 판로를 완비했습니다.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7;padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🏅 국제 표준(ISO) 및 최고 권위 감정 기관 파트너십</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">ISO 예술품 감정 표준 인증을 획득한 <strong>세계문화유산감정사협회</strong> 및 중국 최고 권위의 감정 기관들과 협력하여 객관적인 감정을 수행합니다.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🌐 국제 문화유산 진흥 협력</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">글로벌 네트워크를 보유한 <strong>UN 피스코 파크골프연맹</strong>과의 문화유산 진흥 협력을 통해 국제 교류의 외연을 넓히고 있습니다.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [5] 감정 비용 -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">04. 수수료 안내</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 20px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">공정하고 투명한 <span style=\"color:#0f3460\">감정 비용 안내</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b\">1단계. 신청금 (진위 감정비용) : <span style=\"color:#d97706;font-size:18px\">30만 원</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:13.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:4px\">* 접수 시 납부하며, 전문 감정위원단의 정밀 진위 감정 비용입니다.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;margin-bottom:10px\">2단계. 후정산 (가격 감정비용) : 구간별 누진 합산 적용</div>\n    <div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:16px\">\n    <table style=\"width:100%;min-width:420px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;text-align:center\">\n      <thead><tr style=\"background:#0f3460;color:#fff\">\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">감정 가액 구간</th>\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">적용 요율</th>\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">산출 방식</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">1억 원 미만</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.3%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">1억 원 미만 구간 금액 × 0.3%</td></tr>\n        <tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">1억 원 이상 ~ 10억 원 미만</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.2%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">해당 구간 초과 금액 × 0.2%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">10억 원 이상</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.1%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">10억 원 초과 금액 × 0.1%</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table></div>\n    <div style=\"background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13.5px;color:#78350f\"><strong>💡 가격 감정비용(후정산) 계산 예시 (감정가 15억 원 작품 기준)</strong><br>(1억 원 × 0.3%) + (9억 원 × 0.2%) + (5억 원 × 0.1%) = 30만 원 + 180만 원 + 50만 원 = <strong>총 260만 원</strong></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [6] 일정·접수 -->\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e293b 0%,#0f172a 100%);color:#fff;padding:40px 26px;border-radius:16px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.12)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#f3d06b;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">05. 행사 및 접수 안내</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff;line-height:1.4\">중국 예술품 특별 감정 및 선발 작업</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#cbd5e1;margin:0 0 28px\">중국 박물관 해외회류(海外回流·해외 유출 문화재 본국 환수) 프로젝트 및<br>RWA 상장을 위한 뜻깊은 자리에 많은 관심과 참여를 부탁드립니다.</p>\n    <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;text-align:left;margin-bottom:28px;font-size:15px\">\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 주최 :</strong> 천도예술품국제교류센터</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 대상 :</strong> 중국 문화유산 및 고미술·예술품 일체</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 일시 :</strong> <strong>2026년 11월 27일(금) 오전 9시부터</strong></div>\n      <div><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 장소 :</strong> 서울특별시 서대문구 남가좌동 382-6, DMC 빌딩 1~2층</div>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"tel:010-8606-1141\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d4af37,#b8860b);color:#16213e;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:50px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(212,175,55,.35)\">📞 접수 및 문의 : 010-8606-1141</a>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8\">주최 · 천도예술품국제교류센터</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n", "i18n": {"en": {"title": "Special Appraisal & Selection of Chinese Cultural Heritage and Art (27 Nov 2026)", "body": "From 9:00 a.m. on Friday, 27 November 2026, at the DMC Building (1F–2F), Namgajwa-dong, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul. Appraisal and selection for the Chinese museum repatriation (海外回流) project and RWA listing. Registration and inquiries: +82-10-8606-1141.", "html": "<div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;font-family:'Pretendard','Noto Sans KR',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;color:#222;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-align:left\">\n\n  <!-- [1] Cover -->\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16213e 0%,#1f2c4a 55%,#0f3460 100%);color:#fff;padding:50px 28px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.12);border:1px solid #d4af37\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;background:rgba(212,175,55,.2);color:#f3d06b;border:1px solid #d4af37;padding:6px 16px;border-radius:50px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:20px\">[Invitation] A New Paradigm in Global Art Trading</span>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff\">Chinese Cultural Heritage and Artworks<br><span style=\"color:#f3d06b\">Special Appraisal &amp; Selection Event</span></h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#e0e6ed;margin:0 0 32px\">A meaningful opportunity for the treasured artworks in your collection<br>to reach the world market and museums</p>\n    <div style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding-top:20px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#d4af37\">Host : TianDao Arts International Exchange Center (Chairman Jang Yuseong)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [2] Vision -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">01. Founding Vision</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 16px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">Why <span style=\"color:#b8860b\">TianDao Arts International Exchange Center</span>, and why now?</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:15px;color:#4a5568;margin:0 0 20px\">TianDao Arts International Exchange Center was founded to lead transparent exchange and active trading of artworks worldwide, built on an innovative <strong>RWA (Real World Asset)</strong> system and the <strong>STO (Security Token Offering) framework taking effect in February 2027</strong>.</p>\n    <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border-left:4px solid #d4af37;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b\">\"Moving beyond the closed antiques market, we are building a global digital trading standard that anyone can trust and use.\"</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [3] RWA & STO -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">02. Core Infrastructure</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 24px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">Two financial and technology systems that <span style=\"color:#0f3460\">maximize the value of artworks</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"background:#f1f5f9;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0f3460;margin-bottom:8px\">① RWA (Real World Asset)</div>\n      <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155\">\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><strong>Concept:</strong> Technology that converts tangible and intangible real-world assets, such as artworks, into blockchain-based digital tokens</li>\n        <li><strong>Expected benefits:</strong> Appraisal history and ownership records are permanently recorded, fundamentally preventing forgery and tampering, and securing 24-hour global liquidity</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background:#fdfbf7;border:1px solid #ebd9a6;padding:22px;border-radius:12px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#9a6b00;margin-bottom:8px\">② STO (Security Token Offering)</div>\n      <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155\">\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><strong>Concept:</strong> A method of giving tokens backed by physical assets the status of \"securities\" under the Capital Markets Act, so they can be legally issued and distributed within the regulated system</li>\n        <li><strong>Expected benefits:</strong> With the <strong>framework taking effect in February 2027</strong>, high-value artworks can be fractionally monetized and collectors can raise funds smoothly</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [4] Credibility & channels -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">03. Global Network</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 24px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">Complete credibility and a proven <span style=\"color:#b8860b\">global sales channel</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7;padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🏛️ A solid global purchasing and sales network</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">We have concluded purchasing agency agreements with major Chinese state-run, public, and private museums and leading collectors around the world, establishing a complete channel for actual sales.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7;padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🏅 International standard (ISO) and top-authority appraisal institution partnerships</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">We carry out objective appraisals in cooperation with the <strong>World Cultural Heritage Appraisers Association</strong>, which holds ISO art appraisal standard certification, and China's most authoritative appraisal institutions.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🌐 International cultural heritage promotion cooperation</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">Through cultural heritage promotion cooperation with the <strong>UN Pisco Park Golf Federation</strong>, which has a global network, we are broadening the reach of international exchange.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [5] Appraisal fees -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">04. Fee Guide</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 20px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">Fair and transparent <span style=\"color:#0f3460\">appraisal fee guide</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b\">Step 1. Application fee (authenticity appraisal fee) : <span style=\"color:#d97706;font-size:18px\">KRW 300,000</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:13.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:4px\">* Payable at registration; this covers the detailed authenticity appraisal by the panel of expert appraisers.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;margin-bottom:10px\">Step 2. Post-settlement (valuation appraisal fee) : Applied as a cumulative sum by tier</div>\n    <div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:16px\">\n    <table style=\"width:100%;min-width:420px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;text-align:center\">\n      <thead><tr style=\"background:#0f3460;color:#fff\">\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">Appraised Value Tier</th>\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">Applicable Rate</th>\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">Calculation Method</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">Under KRW 100 million</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.3%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">Amount in the under-KRW 100 million tier × 0.3%</td></tr>\n        <tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">KRW 100 million to under KRW 1 billion</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.2%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">Amount exceeding the tier threshold × 0.2%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">KRW 1 billion or more</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.1%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">Amount exceeding KRW 1 billion × 0.1%</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table></div>\n    <div style=\"background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13.5px;color:#78350f\"><strong>💡 Valuation appraisal fee (post-settlement) calculation example (for an artwork appraised at KRW 1.5 billion)</strong><br>(KRW 100 million × 0.3%) + (KRW 900 million × 0.2%) + (KRW 500 million × 0.1%) = KRW 300,000 + KRW 1.8 million + KRW 500,000 = <strong>total KRW 2.6 million</strong></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [6] Schedule & registration -->\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e293b 0%,#0f172a 100%);color:#fff;padding:40px 26px;border-radius:16px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.12)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#f3d06b;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">05. Event and Registration Information</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff;line-height:1.4\">Special Appraisal and Selection of Chinese Artworks</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#cbd5e1;margin:0 0 28px\">We warmly invite your interest and participation in this meaningful occasion for the Chinese museum 海外回流 (repatriation of cultural relics from overseas) project<br>and for RWA listing.</p>\n    <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;text-align:left;margin-bottom:28px;font-size:15px\">\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• Host :</strong> TianDao Arts International Exchange Center</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• Scope :</strong> All Chinese cultural heritage, antiques, and artworks</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• Date :</strong> <strong>Friday, 27 November 2026, from 9:00 a.m.</strong></div>\n      <div><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• Venue :</strong> DMC Building 1F–2F, 382-6 Namgajwa-dong, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul</div>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"tel:010-8606-1141\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d4af37,#b8860b);color:#16213e;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:50px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(212,175,55,.35)\">📞 Registration &amp; Inquiries : 010-8606-1141</a>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8\">Host · TianDao Arts International Exchange Center</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n"}, "zh": {"title": "中國文化遺產及藝術品特別鑑定·甄選會（2026年11月27日）", "body": "2026年11月27日（星期五）上午9時起，於首爾西大門區南加佐洞DMC大樓1~2樓舉行。為中國博物館海外回流項目及RWA上市進行鑑定與甄選。報名及諮詢：010-8606-1141。", "html": "<div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;font-family:'Pretendard','Noto Sans KR',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;color:#222;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-align:left\">\n\n  <!-- [1] 表紙 -->\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16213e 0%,#1f2c4a 55%,#0f3460 100%);color:#fff;padding:50px 28px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.12);border:1px solid #d4af37\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;background:rgba(212,175,55,.2);color:#f3d06b;border:1px solid #d4af37;padding:6px 16px;border-radius:50px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:20px\">[誠摯邀請] 全球藝術品交易的新典範</span>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff\">中國文化遺產及藝術品<br><span style=\"color:#f3d06b\">特別鑑定・遴選會</span> 盛大舉行</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#e0e6ed;margin:0 0 32px\">您珍藏的寶貴藝術品<br>邁向世界市場與博物館的難得契機</p>\n    <div style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding-top:20px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#d4af37\">主辦 : 天道藝術品國際交流中心 (會長 Jang Yuseong)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [2] 願景 -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">01. 創立願景</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 16px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">為何現在要選擇<span style=\"color:#b8860b\">天道藝術品國際交流中心</span>？</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:15px;color:#4a5568;margin:0 0 20px\">天道藝術品國際交流中心以創新的<strong>RWA（現實世界資產）</strong>系統與即將於<strong>2027年2月實施的STO（證券型代幣）</strong>制度為基礎，為引領全球藝術品的透明交流與交易活絡而成立。</p>\n    <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border-left:4px solid #d4af37;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b\">「超越封閉的古美術市場，打造人人皆可信賴、可交易的全球數位交易標準。」</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [3] RWA & STO -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">02. 核心基礎架構</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 24px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">將藝術品價值極大化的<span style=\"color:#0f3460\">兩大金融・技術系統</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"background:#f1f5f9;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0f3460;margin-bottom:8px\">① RWA (Real World Asset · 現實世界資產)</div>\n      <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155\">\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><strong>概念：</strong> 將藝術品等現實世界的有形・無形資產，轉換為以區塊鏈為基礎的數位代幣之技術</li>\n        <li><strong>預期效益：</strong> 鑑定紀錄與所有權歷程永久留存，從根本杜絕偽造與竄改，並確保24小時全球流動性</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background:#fdfbf7;border:1px solid #ebd9a6;padding:22px;border-radius:12px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#9a6b00;margin-bottom:8px\">② STO (Security Token Offering · 證券型代幣發行)</div>\n      <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155\">\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><strong>概念：</strong> 賦予以實體資產為基礎的代幣《資本市場法》上的「證券性」，在制度框架內合法發行、流通的方式</li>\n        <li><strong>預期效益：</strong> 配合<strong>2027年2月制度實施</strong>，實現高價藝術品的分割流動化，並讓藏家順利籌措資金</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [4] 公信力・銷售管道 -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">03. 全球網絡</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 24px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">完善的公信力與經驗證的<span style=\"color:#b8860b\">全球銷售管道</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7;padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🏛️ 穩固的全球採購・銷售網絡</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">已與中國主要國立、公立及民營博物館，以及全球知名收藏家簽訂代購合約，具備確實可行的出售管道。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7;padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🏅 國際標準（ISO）及最高權威鑑定機構夥伴關係</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">與取得ISO藝術品鑑定標準認證的<strong>世界文化遺產鑑定師協會</strong>及中國最具權威的鑑定機構合作，進行客觀公正的鑑定。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🌐 國際文化遺產推廣合作</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">透過與擁有全球網絡的<strong>聯合國皮斯科門球聯盟</strong>進行文化遺產推廣合作，持續拓展國際交流的版圖。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [5] 鑑定費用 -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">04. 費用說明</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 20px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">公平透明的<span style=\"color:#0f3460\">鑑定費用說明</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b\">第1階段. 申請費（真偽鑑定費用） : <span style=\"color:#d97706;font-size:18px\">30萬韓元</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:13.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:4px\">* 於受理時繳納，為專業鑑定委員團精密真偽鑑定之費用。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;margin-bottom:10px\">第2階段. 後結算（價格鑑定費用） : 依級距累進合計計算</div>\n    <div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:16px\">\n    <table style=\"width:100%;min-width:420px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;text-align:center\">\n      <thead><tr style=\"background:#0f3460;color:#fff\">\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">鑑定價額級距</th>\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">適用費率</th>\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">計算方式</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">未滿1億韓元</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.3%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">未滿1億韓元級距金額 × 0.3%</td></tr>\n        <tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">1億韓元以上 ~ 未滿10億韓元</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.2%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">超過該級距之金額 × 0.2%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">10億韓元以上</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.1%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">超過10億韓元之金額 × 0.1%</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table></div>\n    <div style=\"background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13.5px;color:#78350f\"><strong>💡 價格鑑定費用（後結算）計算範例（以鑑定價15億韓元之作品為例）</strong><br>(1億韓元 × 0.3%) + (9億韓元 × 0.2%) + (5億韓元 × 0.1%) = 30萬韓元 + 180萬韓元 + 50萬韓元 = <strong>合計260萬韓元</strong></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [6] 日程・受理 -->\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e293b 0%,#0f172a 100%);color:#fff;padding:40px 26px;border-radius:16px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.12)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#f3d06b;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">05. 活動及受理說明</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff;line-height:1.4\">中國藝術品特別鑑定及遴選作業</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#cbd5e1;margin:0 0 28px\">中國博物館海外回流（海外流失文物回歸祖國）計畫及<br>RWA上市的重要盛會，誠摯期盼您的關注與蒞臨參與。</p>\n    <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;text-align:left;margin-bottom:28px;font-size:15px\">\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 主辦 :</strong> 天道藝術品國際交流中心</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 對象 :</strong> 中國文化遺產及古美術・藝術品全類</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 時間 :</strong> <strong>2026年11月27日（星期五）上午9時起</strong></div>\n      <div><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 地點 :</strong> 首爾特別市西大門區南加佐洞382-6 DMC大樓1~2樓</div>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"tel:010-8606-1141\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d4af37,#b8860b);color:#16213e;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:50px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(212,175,55,.35)\">📞 受理及洽詢 : 010-8606-1141</a>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8\">主辦 · 天道藝術品國際交流中心</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n"}, "ja": {"title": "中国文化遺産・美術品 特別鑑定・選定会 開催（2026年11月27日）", "body": "2026年11月27日（金）午前9時から、ソウル西大門区南加佐洞 DMCビル1〜2階にて開催します。中国の博物館による海外回流プロジェクトおよびRWA上場に向けた鑑定・選定です。受付・お問い合わせ：010-8606-1141。", "html": "<div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;font-family:'Pretendard','Noto Sans KR',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;color:#222;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-align:left\">\n\n  <!-- [1] 表紙 -->\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16213e 0%,#1f2c4a 55%,#0f3460 100%);color:#fff;padding:50px 28px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.12);border:1px solid #d4af37\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;background:rgba(212,175,55,.2);color:#f3d06b;border:1px solid #d4af37;padding:6px 16px;border-radius:50px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:20px\">[ご招待] グローバル美術品取引の新たなパラダイム</span>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff\">中国文化遺産および美術品<br><span style=\"color:#f3d06b\">特別鑑定・選抜会</span>の開催</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#e0e6ed;margin:0 0 32px\">ご所蔵の貴重な美術品が<br>世界の市場と博物館へ羽ばたく意義深い機会</p>\n    <div style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding-top:20px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#d4af37\">主催 : 天道芸術品国際交流センター (会長 チャン・ユソン)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [2] ビジョン -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">01. 設立ビジョン</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 16px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">なぜ今、<span style=\"color:#b8860b\">天道芸術品国際交流センター</span>なのでしょうか?</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:15px;color:#4a5568;margin:0 0 20px\">天道芸術品国際交流センターは、革新的な<strong>RWA(実物連動資産)</strong>システムと、来る<strong>2027年2月に施行されるSTO(トークン証券)</strong>制度を基盤として、世界の美術品の透明性の高い交流と取引の活性化を牽引するために設立されました。</p>\n    <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border-left:4px solid #d4af37;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b\">「閉鎖的な骨董市場を超えて、誰もが信頼して取引できるグローバルなデジタル取引の標準を築きます。」</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [3] RWA & STO -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">02. 中核インフラ</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 24px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">美術品の価値を最大化する<span style=\"color:#0f3460\">2大金融・技術システム</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"background:#f1f5f9;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0f3460;margin-bottom:8px\">① RWA (Real World Asset · 実物連動資産)</div>\n      <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155\">\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><strong>概念:</strong> 美術品など現実世界の有形・無形資産を、ブロックチェーンベースのデジタルトークンに変換する技術</li>\n        <li><strong>期待効果:</strong> 鑑定履歴および所有権の履歴が永久に記録され、偽造・改ざんを根本から防止し、24時間のグローバルな流動性を確保</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background:#fdfbf7;border:1px solid #ebd9a6;padding:22px;border-radius:12px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#9a6b00;margin-bottom:8px\">② STO (Security Token Offering · トークン証券発行)</div>\n      <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155\">\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><strong>概念:</strong> 実物資産ベースのトークンに、資本市場法上の「証券性」を付与し、制度の枠内で合法的に発行・流通させる方式</li>\n        <li><strong>期待効果:</strong> <strong>2027年2月の制度施行</strong>に合わせ、高額美術品の分割流動化と、所蔵家の円滑な資金調達を実現</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [4] 公信力・販路 -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">03. グローバルネットワーク</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 24px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">万全の公信力と実績ある<span style=\"color:#b8860b\">グローバル販売ルート</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7;padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🏛️ 盤石なグローバル売買ネットワークを確保</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">中国の主要な国公立・民営博物館や、世界各地の有力収集家と購入代行契約を締結し、実質的な売却ルートを整えております。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7;padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🏅 国際標準(ISO)および最高権威の鑑定機関とのパートナーシップ</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">ISO美術品鑑定標準の認証を取得した<strong>世界文化遺産鑑定士協会</strong>および中国最高権威の鑑定機関と連携し、客観的な鑑定を行います。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1a202c;margin-bottom:4px\">🌐 国際文化遺産振興協力</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5568\">グローバルなネットワークを有する<strong>国連ピスコパークゴルフ連盟</strong>との文化遺産振興協力を通じて、国際交流の裾野を広げております。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [5] 鑑定費用 -->\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:36px 26px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.05)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#0f3460;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">04. 手数料のご案内</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 20px;color:#111;line-height:1.4\">公正で透明な<span style=\"color:#0f3460\">鑑定費用のご案内</span></h3>\n    <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b\">第1段階. 申込金 (真贋鑑定費用) : <span style=\"color:#d97706;font-size:18px\">30万ウォン</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:13.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:4px\">* 受付時にお支払いいただく、専門鑑定委員団による精密な真贋鑑定の費用です。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;margin-bottom:10px\">第2段階. 後精算 (価格鑑定費用) : 区間別累進合算を適用</div>\n    <div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:16px\">\n    <table style=\"width:100%;min-width:420px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;text-align:center\">\n      <thead><tr style=\"background:#0f3460;color:#fff\">\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">鑑定価額区間</th>\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">適用料率</th>\n        <th style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #0f3460\">算出方法</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">1億ウォン未満</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.3%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">1億ウォン未満の区間の金額 × 0.3%</td></tr>\n        <tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">1億ウォン以上 ~ 10億ウォン未満</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.2%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">当該区間の超過金額 × 0.2%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:600\">10億ウォン以上</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#d97706;font-weight:700\">0.1%</td><td style=\"padding:12px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">10億ウォン超過分の金額 × 0.1%</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table></div>\n    <div style=\"background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13.5px;color:#78350f\"><strong>💡 価格鑑定費用(後精算)の計算例 (鑑定額15億ウォンの作品の場合)</strong><br>(1億ウォン × 0.3%) + (9億ウォン × 0.2%) + (5億ウォン × 0.1%) = 30万ウォン + 180万ウォン + 50万ウォン = <strong>合計260万ウォン</strong></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- [6] 日程・受付 -->\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e293b 0%,#0f172a 100%);color:#fff;padding:40px 26px;border-radius:16px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.12)\">\n    <div style=\"color:#f3d06b;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">05. 開催および受付のご案内</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff;line-height:1.4\">中国美術品特別鑑定・選抜作業</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#cbd5e1;margin:0 0 28px\">中国博物館の海外回流(海外流出文化財の本国還流)プロジェクトおよび<br>RWA上場のための意義深い場に、多くのご関心とご参加をお願い申し上げます。</p>\n    <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;text-align:left;margin-bottom:28px;font-size:15px\">\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 主催 :</strong> 天道芸術品国際交流センター</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 対象 :</strong> 中国文化遺産および骨董・美術品全般</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 日時 :</strong> <strong>2026年11月27日（金）午前9時から</strong></div>\n      <div><strong style=\"color:#f3d06b;display:inline-block;width:75px\">• 会場 :</strong> ソウル特別市西大門区南加佐洞382-6 DMCビル1〜2階</div>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"tel:010-8606-1141\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d4af37,#b8860b);color:#16213e;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:50px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(212,175,55,.35)\">📞 受付・お問い合わせ : 010-8606-1141</a>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8\">主催 · 天道芸術品国際交流センター</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n"}}}